  "extraction_notes": "Catalyst 2 is drawn as an ortho-amidophenylboronic acid with CF3; interpreted as 2-(N,N-diisopropylcarbamoyl)-4-(trifluoromethyl)phenylboronic acid based on known literature (Hall's MIBA-type catalyst). Catalyst 3 is an N-methylpyridinium boronic acid with unspecified counterion X\u207b. The exact regiochemistry of catalyst 3 (2-borono vs 3-borono) was interpreted as 2-borono-1-methylpyridin-1-ium based on drawing."
